    "title": "Saint Leo Lions, led by former Lyman player Briana Neal, earn 5-4 victory in NCAA Division II Tournament",
    "text": "Former Lyman High School softball player Briana Neal and her Saint Leo Lions teammates secured a 5-4 win over the West Texas A&M Buffaloes in the NCAA Division II Tournament on Sunday, May 31.\nThe matchup began at 11 a.m. at Jim Frost Stadium.\nThe Saint Leo Lions are scheduled to play again at Jim Frost Stadium on Tuesday, June 2, with the game starting at 6 p.m.\nBriana Neal — Second baseman — Senior — 5′6″ — Hometown: Sanford",
